    "tags": [
     {
      "name": "Jamcharts",
      "notes": "Easy-breezy major jamming bounds along until a pronounced change in demeanor around 11:00 when the jam turns minor and becomes a heavy-duty, lumbering rock-out a la the 6/27/25 \"Golden Age\" but not quite as punishing. After building to a weighty peak, the \"LSG\" riff returns and leads to a final chorus to bring it to a close."
     }
